WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.002 --> 00:00:01.630
HI THERE YOUTUBE.
MY NAME'S JOHN GREEN.

00:00:01.632 --> 00:00:02.958
I'M ONE HALF
OF THE VLOGBROTHERS

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:05.205
ALONG WITH MY BROTHER, HANK.
- HI, I'M HANK.

00:00:05.207 --> 00:00:06.997
HANK AND I LIVE ON OPPOSITE SIDES OF THE COUNTRY.

00:00:06.998 --> 00:00:08.500
NOW THAT YOUTUBE
COMES IN WIDESCREEN,

00:00:08.502 --> 00:00:10.400
I CAN SHOW YOU
APPROXIMATELY WHERE WE LIVE.

00:00:10.402 --> 00:00:12.012
HANK LIVES HERE,
(points)

00:00:12.013 --> 00:00:13.983
AND I LIVE HERE.
(points)

00:00:13.985 --> 00:00:15.417
DESPITE LIVING ON OPPOSITE
SIDES OF THE COUNTRY,

00:00:15.418 --> 00:00:17.850
OUR OFFICES LOOK
REALLY, REALLY SIMILAR.

00:00:17.852 --> 00:00:19.272
WHICH I NEVER NOTICED
BEFORE.

00:00:19.273 --> 00:00:20.622
FOR THE PAST FEW YEARS,
JOHN AND I HAVE BEEN

00:00:20.623 --> 00:00:23.150
BRIDGING THAT DISTANCE
BY COMMUNICATING THROUGH

00:00:23.152 --> 00:00:24.377
VIDEO BLOGS
ON YOUTUBE.

00:00:24.378 --> 00:00:25.813
BUT THIS PROJECT
HASN'T BEEN JUST ABOUT US

00:00:25.815 --> 00:00:27.390
FOR A
LONG TIME NOW.

00:00:27.392 --> 00:00:29.225
WE'RE HERE TODAY TO INTRODUCE SOME OF OUR FAVORITE VIDEOS

00:00:29.227 --> 00:00:31.468
FROM THE
2008 PROJECT FOR AWESOME,

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:32.923
AN ANNUAL EVENT
IN THE HOLIDAY SEASON,

00:00:32.925 --> 00:00:35.017
WHEN TENS OF THOUSANDS
OF YOUTUBERS COME TOGETHER

00:00:35.018 --> 00:00:37.098
TO BRING ATTENTION
TO CHARITABLE ORGANIZATIONS

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:38.293
THROUGHOUT
THE WORLD.

00:00:38.295 --> 00:00:39.790
WHAT I LOVE ABOUT THE
PROJECT FOR AWESOME IS NOT ONLY

00:00:39.792 --> 00:00:42.293
THAT IT REMINDS US THAT
THE TRUE SPIRIT OF THIS SEASON

00:00:42.295 --> 00:00:44.275
IS GIVING,
BUT ALSO THAT IT ALLOWS ME

00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:47.443
TO QUICKLY AND EFFICIENTLY DEAL WITH ALL MY PRESENT-BUYING.

00:00:47.445 --> 00:00:48.647
FOR INSTANCE,
ONE OF THE VIDEOS THAT WE'RE

00:00:48.648 --> 00:00:50.085
FEATURING TODAY
IS HEIFER INTERNATIONAL,

00:00:50.087 --> 00:00:52.347
AN ORGANIZATION
THAT ALLOWS PEOPLE LIKE ME

00:00:52.348 --> 00:00:55.637
TO BUY ANIMALS FOR PEOPLE
LIKE MY BROTHER, HANK.

00:00:55.638 --> 00:00:58.080
AWESOME.
I WOULD LIKE A PLATYPUS.

00:00:58.082 --> 00:01:00.687
OR MAYBE A LIGER!
A LIGER WOULD BE AMAZING.

00:01:00.688 --> 00:01:02.725
WELL ACTUALLY, I'M NOT BUYING AN ANIMAL "FOR YOU",

00:01:02.727 --> 00:01:05.055
I'M BUYING AN ANIMAL
"FOR" YOU,

00:01:05.057 --> 00:01:07.870
THAT GOES
TO SOMEONE WHO NEEDS IT.

00:01:07.872 --> 00:01:09.890
YEAH O-O-OKAY!
I-

00:01:09.892 --> 00:01:12.532
I KINDA HAD MY HEART
SET ON THE LIGER,

00:01:12.533 --> 00:01:14.202
(disappointed)
BUT UH, THIS IS GOOD TOO.

00:01:14.203 --> 00:01:15.873
AND THE COOLEST PART
IS YOU DON'T EVEN HAVE TO BUY

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:18.210
A FULL ANIMAL.
YOU CAN BUY A PARTICULAR PART

00:01:18.212 --> 00:01:19.275
OF AN ANIMAL.

00:01:19.277 --> 00:01:20.942
FOR INSTANCE, HANK,
THIS YEAR FOR CHRISTMAS,

00:01:20.943 --> 00:01:22.617
I'M GOING TO TELL YOU
IN ADVANCE

00:01:22.618 --> 00:01:24.942
THAT I GOT YOU
FIVE LLAMA BUTTS.

00:01:24.943 --> 00:01:27.552
NOW, ADMITTEDLY, FOR
THE PRICE OF FIVE LLAMA BUTTS

00:01:27.553 --> 00:01:29.083
I COULD HAVE
GOTTEN YOU A LLAMA,

00:01:29.085 --> 00:01:31.888
BUT I DIDN'T WANT
TO GET YOU A LLAMA.

00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:33.928
I WANTED YOU TO GET
A LOT OF LLAMA BUTT.

00:01:33.930 --> 00:01:35.293
(shocked gasp)

00:01:35.295 --> 00:01:37.183
ANYWAY,
YOUTUBE WAS EXTREMELY,

00:01:37.185 --> 00:01:39.132
 EXTREMELY, EXTREMELY, EXTREMELY KIND THIS YEAR

00:01:39.133 --> 00:01:41.197
TO ALLOW US TO BECOME
GUEST EDITORS OF THE FRONT PAGE

00:01:41.198 --> 00:01:42.453
FOR A DAY.

00:01:42.455 --> 00:01:44.297
SO WE'VE TAKEN THIS RESPONSIBILITY EXTREMELY SERIOUSLY,

00:01:44.298 --> 00:01:46.098
WE HAVEN'T PUT ANY
OF OUR OWN VIDEOS UP,

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:47.377
LIKE OPRAH DID
THAT ONE TIME,

00:01:47.378 --> 00:01:49.405
AND WE HAVEN'T JUST CHOSEN
OUR BEST FRIENDS.

00:01:49.407 --> 00:01:50.907
THOUGH,
OUR PARENTS MADE A VIDEO,

00:01:50.908 --> 00:01:53.328
AND I... UH,
WE INCLUDED THAT ONE.

00:01:53.330 --> 00:01:55.582
I MEAN, THEY'RE OUR PARENTS.
WE OWE THEM. A LOT.

00:01:55.583 --> 00:01:57.868
BUT REST ASSURED, THE DECISION WAS EXTREMELY DIFFICULT!

00:01:57.870 --> 00:01:59.650
AND I FEEL VERY GUILTY
ABOUT NOT PUTTING

00:01:59.652 --> 00:02:01.417
SOME OF THE REALLY AMAZING
PROJECT FOR AWESOME VIDEOS

00:02:01.418 --> 00:02:02.985
ON THE FRONT PAGE THAT
I COULDN'T.

00:02:02.987 --> 00:02:04.350
SO YOU SHOULD PROBABLY
JUST SEARCH AROUND

00:02:04.352 --> 00:02:06.348
FOR PROJECT FOR AWESOME VIDEOS
BECAUSE THERE ARE "LOTS"

00:02:06.350 --> 00:02:07.865
THAT ARE REALLY AMAZING
THAT DIDN'T GET FEATURED

00:02:07.867 --> 00:02:08.992
ON THE
FRONT PAGE.

00:02:08.993 --> 00:02:10.183
I'D LIKE TO THANK
ALL THE PEOPLE

00:02:10.185 --> 00:02:11.362
WHO WE KNOW AS
"NERDFIGHTERS",

00:02:11.363 --> 00:02:13.125
WHO HELPED MAKE THIS
PROJECT SUCH A SUCCESS.

00:02:13.127 --> 00:02:14.658
AND I WANT TO SAY
THANKS TO EVERYONE

00:02:14.660 --> 00:02:16.093
WHO'S WATCHING THIS
INSIDE THIS BOX

00:02:16.095 --> 00:02:17.563
FOR WATCHING A VIDEO
THAT'S NOT ABOUT

00:02:17.565 --> 00:02:19.770
TURKISH, SOCCER,
OR WATER-SKIING SQUIRRELS.

00:02:19.772 --> 00:02:20.935
BUT MOST OF ALL,

00:02:20.937 --> 00:02:22.098
WE WANT TO THANK YOU
FOR CHECKING OUT

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:23.457
THE PROJECT FOR AWESOME
VIDEOS

00:02:23.458 --> 00:02:25.140
AND FOR CONSIDERING GIVING
YOUR TIME AND MONEY

00:02:25.142 --> 00:02:27.045
TO PEOPLE AND ORGANIZATIONS
WHO DO THINGS BECAUSE

00:02:27.047 --> 00:02:28.542
THEY'RE JUST
THE RIGHT THING TO DO.

00:02:28.543 --> 00:02:30.583
THIS IS HANK GREEN
FOR THE VLOGBROTHERS.

00:02:30.585 --> 00:02:31.903
DON'T FORGET
TO BE AWESOME.

00:02:31.903 --> 00:02:32.670
Closed Captioning
